 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "TicTacToe(n, m, k) creates an empty n x m board. move(row, col, player) places the mark of player 1 or 2 on an empty cell and returns that player when the mark completes k or more consecutive own marks horizontally, vertically or along either diagonal, and 0 otherwise. Moves are valid and no move follows a win.",
